  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forum Asia 2011-2019 - Forum Asia 2011-2016 Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Asia 2011-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FORUM-ASIA is a key regional human rights organization with extensive experience in both capacity development and advocacy. The aim is to   support the FA in their regional work focusing on HR defenders and    advocacy towards ASEAN with a core support of total 34 million kronor for the implementation of FORUM-Asia&apos;s strategic plan for the period  1 June 2011 - 31 December 2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FORUM-ASIA &#xe4;r en central regional MR organisation med l&#xe5;ng erfarenhet av b&#xe5;de kapacitetsutveckling och p&#xe5;verkansarbete. Syftet &#xe4;r att       st&#xf6;dja FA i deras regionala arbete med fokus p&#xe5; mr-f&#xf6;rsvarare och     p&#xe5;verkansarbete gentemot ASEAN med org.st&#xf6;d p&#xe5; totalt 34 000 000      kronor f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av FORUM-ASIAs strategiska plan under        perioden 1 juni 2011 - 31 december 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
